--- !u!114 &410000000021
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1205405490}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8a7a727d1145497380829c7f9c55623a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BossIntroDialogue
  dialogueText: {fileID: 410000000003}
  progressText: {fileID: 410000000013}
  pages:
  - 'Welcome to the new office!

    It looks peaceful, but the computers

    strongly
    disagree.'
  - 'Check the task card regularly.

    It shows the problem, floor, room,

    and
    remaining time.


    Find the correct floor and room.

    Then complete the
    mini-game to fix it.


    Wrong room? People will stare.

    The problem stays,
    but the

    embarrassment is free.'
  - 'Every task has a time limit.

    Finish it in time, and a new task

    will
    appear.


    An unfinished task does not count.

    Sadly, printers never repair

    themselves.'
  - 'The bar shows how much patience

    I have left. Ignoring tasks will

    make
    it go down.


    As the bar drops, my face gets angrier.

    Do not take it
    personally...

    actually, you probably should.'
  - 'Wake up the modems, remove viruses,

    fix the cables, and stop suspicious

    emails
    before they cause trouble.


    Complete the tasks and do not empty

    my
    patience bar. Save the office,

    and I may consider a coffee break...

    may.'
  inputDelay: 0.2
